      "start_seconds": 308.97,
      "end_seconds": 340.14,
      "duration_seconds": 31.17,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible blood clot in the lung is my leading thought, not anything worse let's get a D-dimer blood test, for possible clot you need to go to hospital now for a scan i think the medical team should see you too come back or go to emergency straight away if you feel faint book a review straight away right, that's the plan do you wanna ask me anything?"
